            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Awakening&quot;</h2>Kyoya awakens in a dimly lit room.<br>According to the girl who happened to pass by, the world has perished.<br>Reluctant to believe, Kyoya sets off with the girl to search for other living beings,<br>journeying through the ruined world together.<br><br>However, the girl had a purpose.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743940/extras/9543cb8e4f165fd70ff784f1fb6bf9ac.avif?t=1775694032\" width=396 height=222 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;The Girl's Purpose&quot;</h2>To atone for the sins of humanity,<br>she must continue to die.<br>Again and again, dozens of times, hundreds of times, thousands of times, tens of thousands of times.<br><br>She dies and then comes back to life.<br>As he watches her, who knows only suffering,<br>Kyoya starts to desire to teach her about happiness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743940/extras/cf35c16c584ca6322f2fedb0ffd5c6e9.avif?t=1775694032\" width=396 height=222 /></span><br><br><strong>NOTICE</strong><br><br>The following updates have been implemented in the latest version compared to the old version released in 2017 with only English.<br><br>- Language additions: Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br>- Improvements on visual assets and English localization text<br>- Title name change<br><br>* Voices available in Japanese only for the heroine.",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Awakening&quot;</h2>Kyoya awakens in a dimly lit room.<br>According to the girl who happened to pass by, the world has perished.<br>Reluctant to believe, Kyoya sets off with the girl to search for other living beings,<br>journeying through the ruined world together.<br><br>However, the girl had a purpose.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743940/extras/9543cb8e4f165fd70ff784f1fb6bf9ac.avif?t=1775694032\" width=396 height=222 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;The Girl's Purpose&quot;</h2>To atone for the sins of humanity,<br>she must continue to die.<br>Again and again, dozens of times, hundreds of times, thousands of times, tens of thousands of times.<br><br>She dies and then comes back to life.<br>As he watches her, who knows only suffering,<br>Kyoya starts to desire to teach her about happiness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743940/extras/cf35c16c584ca6322f2fedb0ffd5c6e9.avif?t=1775694032\" width=396 height=222 /></span><br><br><strong>NOTICE</strong><br><br>The following updates have been implemented in the latest version compared to the old version released in 2017 with only English.<br><br>- Language additions: Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br>- Improvements on visual assets and English localization text<br>- Title name change<br><br>* Voices available in Japanese only for the heroine.",
